{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S08、S11、S12等短停留段，话与感受切换过密，容易来不及消化；这些地方X更容易一眼扫完。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y虽然扫读负担稍重，但【】突出关键心理转折，感受又能随音乐节点出现，听觉变化和人物心境之间的对应关系更容易被观众捕捉。尤其是从不甘心、怀念亲近，到意识到孤单、放下立即回头的念头，Y交代了更多心理因果，前后也更像一段持续发展的内心经历。音乐感受的具体程度和细腻度也是Y更好，不过短段落需要适当减密。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "aed56ec7-90f2-492e-92d8-7ee97403a58b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T010759288599Z", "elapsed_seconds": 36.781, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:08:36.096077+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6c453e765f878fc3d12edb06cda9928907c4a2cc70c410ad7c4d554f6cc1f4f1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa2388500002